Upstream attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project ports editing capabilities of the IntelliJ IDEA plugin
`i2f-jdbc-procedure-idea-plugin` from the `i2f-turbo-java` project
(author: Ice2Faith), which is distributed under GPL-3.0.

The following files under tools/sources/ are copied from the upstream project
and retain the upstream GPL-3.0 terms:

  - AttrConsts.java
  - FeatureConsts.java
  - ParamsConsts.java
  - TagConsts.java
  - XProc4j.xml
  - procedure.dtd
  - procedure.xml
  - procedure.xml.ft

Generated artifacts in metadata/, syntaxes/, snippets/ and src/generated/ are
derived from these sources by the scripts under tools/.

The upstream Java sources and templates are kept for reproducibility and are
not included in the packaged VSIX. The VSIX contains only generated syntax,
snippets, metadata embedded in the extension bundle, and this attribution.

