Third-party test fixtures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

TextMate grammars under test/grammar/vendor/ originate from VS Code and their
respective grammar projects. They are used only by the test harness and are not
included in the packaged VSIX. Copyright and license for those grammars remain
with their respective authors.

